  "id": "anime-ca957c2d6b4a675f429d",
  "type": "anime",
  "title": "气运世界杯，我能复制所有球星技能",
  "original_title": "qiyunshijiebeiwonengfuzhisuoyouqiuxingjineng",
  "year": 2026,
